      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "i'm like 99% sure that this has no shot at getting added into vrchat, if you want a feature like this then ask the world creator for it as it isn't really that hard to implement.\n\nmain issues:\n\n1. worlds like game worlds this would only serve to be a nuisance and be only annoying regardless of consent options as people would just push others into places that they otherwise shouldn't be able to go to, people already abuse mirrors to all hell we don't need more game ruining features.\n\n2. if it's a feature where a world creator also has to opt their world in to it at what point does the world creator not just make it themselves and have greater control over it?\n\n3. VRC has issues with networking and a feature like this would likely have some weird quirk with it where some 'client' user can come in and forcefully fling everyone...",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
